{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前発売だった「月刊エンタメ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公式には名前が載ってないんだけど\nちゃんと中田も載ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らりんの卒業ってことで\n二人でいろいろお話ししてきました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男っぽくなった(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飯ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストロベリー チョコレート マスカルポーネパンケーキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこれ\n『J.S.パンケーキ』と\n『ギャレットポップコーン』のコラボ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで別れて出てきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好みでかけて～的な感じです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにチラッと見えてるランチョンマット\nこのパンケーキ頼んだ人限定なの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンケーキとポップコーンって\n異色な組み合わせだけど\n意外とふわふわのパンケーキとカリカリのポップコーンが新食感で美味しかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使われてるのが\n「チョコココ キャラメルクリスプ」っていうポップコーンなんだけど\nこれが美味しくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘い系のポップコーンなのに\n手が止まらなくなる感覚があるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このパンケーキは\n終わっちゃったんだけど\nアップル キャラメル マスカルポーネ パンケーキ\nの方はホワイトデーまでやってるはずなので\n是非食べてみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下北沢でロケ中の\nバナナマンさんとバカリズムさんをお見かけした\nって755に書いたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時このパンケーキを食べに\n下北沢へ行ってました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日の\n『そんなバカなマン』を見て思い出して書いた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/03/5686112/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}